WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:31.850
We almost know nothing about this species so we've taken the opportunity

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:33.950
to take ID photos of them, 

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:36.650
and start studying their distribution along this coastline

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:38.950
in order to learn more about this incredible animal.

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:32.870
This is probably a really important marine predator,

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:36.607
and like all rays, serve a really important function in the ecosystem.

00:01:36.607 --> 00:01:38.732
So, I'm hoping that we can do more to protect it.

